            datasheet: "Decade (BCD) counter\n\nCounts 0 … 9, 0 on the rising edge of CLK while EN = 1; Q3..Q0 is the BCD digit. CO = 1 while EN = 1 and the count is 9 (cascade it into the EN of the next digit). CLR = 1 clears it at once.",
